  <item>
    <title>3&amp;4月新歌推荐：黄宣、惘闻、9m88...在暖风中开启一场好梦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680b4bd88aed253fa3779af0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680b4bd88aed253fa3779af0</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 25 Apr 2025 09:00:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎光临「音乐转运商店」</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期给大家分享一下3月和4月听到的新歌</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢这期分享的音乐欢迎在评论区留言互动哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵list：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a> Saturdays Vibrations - FNCY/9m88</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> Two Horses - Black Country, New Road</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> &nbsp;Blue Village - 梦游动物园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="787">13:07</a> &nbsp;追幸福的人 Theme one - 惘闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1802">30:02</a> 翅膀和泥土 - YELLOW 黄宣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2066">34:26</a> 愚人节快乐 - 卢广仲</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>演出推荐:</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>台湾唱作才女 王若琳 全国巡演</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>这场全新的巡演，以「破烂酒店」专辑中第12首「There She Smiles (In a Memory) 她在那里微笑着（在一个回忆中）」为题展开，</span><strong><span>想以一种「快乐跟感伤」的角度来唱一些歌曲</span></strong><span>，住在回忆回圈里的每一个人，在 Joanna 的音乐里，感受不为人知的幽微思绪、 暗思异想、狂欢的哀伤、 优雅的狂喜；哪里都不回、 哪里也都不去，就站在那里 ，站在 Joanna 的音乐宇宙之中，跟着旋转、跳跃、在回忆里微笑。除了延续爱的呼唤巡演的经典曲目之外， Joanna 王若琳也挑选了一些自己喜欢的歌手或是歌曲，更会有未曾演唱过的曲目，给大家惊喜！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fov0pczIBG-UcjfU_PeZL4w77hMs.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>offside festival越位音乐节5.23-25</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>📍浙江省杭州市余杭区径山镇龙皇路99号 径山花海</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvtb7drriyra_XcW8liokZUwa4XH.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>台湾器乐摇滚乐队话梅鹿「鹿行春野」2025 巡演</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>二五年的春日在波折的温差中如期而至，万物轮回有序，今年是话梅鹿成团</span><strong><span>十二周年</span></strong><span>，春光明媚，满目</span><strong><span>「鹿行春野」</span></strong><span>，在一年中阳光最细腻的时刻自然地漫步，汇聚人格思绪的现实体温，也趋向创作的预设场景，于是启程，赴春之邀。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FneGlNN52QUmdCqpShzRyqwV1q2c.jpg"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🎁福利！</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>订阅、评论点赞本期节目，在评论区抽取一位朋友送出王若琳巡演南京演唱会门票一张，感谢大家的支持！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6715d0a60d2f24f2899c8982/lnJ3imzCyUvVKB_05EgvqNQq2x8F.m4a" length="43764656" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:44:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhV9GXIsWaAP6yXOrh7TEYEy5SLl.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
