  <item>
    <title>时间的现实与虚幻：方大同</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67c550c7bf52a16cd12b1451</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67c550c7bf52a16cd12b1451</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Mar 2025 06:54:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎光临「音乐转运商店」</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目的标题来自大同在悼念仪式的手卡上留下来的话</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl1MbcVqOokw6Xj1zoDBpYMUMPNb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这是我第一次真切的感受到对于我重要的人离开的心情</span></p><span></span><p><span>似乎他的音乐早已成为了我们生活的一部分</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你一切都好</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们按照专辑发行的时间顺序</span></p><span></span><p><span>从每张专辑挑选出一部分曲目</span></p><span></span><p><span>和大家一起来感受大同的一生</span></p><span></span><p><span>list：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>You Leave Me Now</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《Soulboy》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="222">3:42</a> 每天每天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="473">7:53</a> 南音</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《爱爱爱》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a>手拖手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a>歌手与模特儿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a>春风吹之吹吹风</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a>诗人的情人</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《未来》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1511">25:11</a>公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a>十九八七</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2064">34:24</a>Love Song</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《橙月》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2334">38:54</a>如果爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2582">43:02</a>爱我吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2871">47:51</a> 黑白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a cla