    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎光临「音乐转运商店」</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期收集整理了一些个人比较喜欢的陈修泽个人/懂团作品</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈修泽</span></p><span></span><p><span>大学学的是剧场幕后工作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>毕业之后把剧场学的东西当成打工，</span></p><span></span><p><span>把组乐团做音乐当成正职。</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历过「那我懂你意思了」乐团。</span></p><span></span><p><span>发行了三张专辑，</span></p><span></span><p><span>「没有的啊」「原谅我不明白你的悲伤」</span></p><span></span><p><span>「没有人在乎你在乎的事」</span></p><span></span><p><span>list：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Intro -没事没事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> 最近</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a> 你孤单的唱着歌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 没有人在乎你在乎的事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 流浪汉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1126">18:46</a> 过气歌手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> 所以我停下来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1714">28:34</a> 不负责任的挽留</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1951">32:31</a> 原谅我不明白你的悲伤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2291">38:11</a> 与恶魔的契约</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2582">43:02</a>最后一支烟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2841">47:21</a> 献给总是美丽的你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3118">51:58</a> Sweetdreams</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3336">55:36</a> 自由的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3613">01:00:13</a>该说再见了朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3842">